# No redirect rules on purpose.
# A 200 rewrite rule for /admin -> /index.html was deployed here and the
# live Worker answered /admin with "307 -> /" instead of serving the page,
# while unknown paths (e.g. /nonexistent) already get index.html 200 from
# the Worker's SPA fallback. So /admin is served by that same fallback and
# this file is kept empty (comments only) so no rule can interfere.
